{"page":"PSMA7","gene":"PSMA7","accession":"O14818","protein":"Proteasome subunit alpha type-7","length":248,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"O14818-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000370873.9"],"refseq":["NM_002792.4"],"refseqProteins":["NP_002783.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-O14818-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O14818-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":94.4,"plddt":[[50,1],[70,9],[90,37],[70,4],[90,3],[70,6],[90,59],[70,5],[90,76],[70,4],[90,34],[70,9],[50,1]]}},"features":[{"type":"Glycosylation","start":130,"end":130,"description":"O-linked (GlcNAc) serine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":153,"end":153,"description":"Phosphotyrosine; by ABL1 and ABL2"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":227,"end":227,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"The 26S proteasome consists of a 20S proteasome core and two 19S regulatory subunits (PubMed:25599644, PubMed:26133119, PubMed:27342858, PubMed:27428775, PubMed:27493187, PubMed:34711951). The 20S proteasome core is a barrel-shaped complex made of 28 subunits that are arranged in four stacked rings (PubMed:25599644, PubMed:26133119, PubMed:27342858, PubMed:27428775, PubMed:27493187, PubMed:34711951). The two outer rings are each formed by seven alpha subunits, and the two inner rings are formed by seven beta subunits (PubMed:25599644, PubMed:26133119, PubMed:27342858, PubMed:27428775, PubMed:27493187, PubMed:34711951). The proteolytic activity is exerted by three beta-subunits PSMB5, PSMB6 and PSMB7 (PubMed:25599644, PubMed:26133119, PubMed:27342858, PubMed:27428775, PubMed:27493187, PubMed:34711951). PSMA7 interacts directly with the PSMG1-PSMG2 heterodimer which promotes 20S proteasome assembly (PubMed:16251969). Interacts with HIF1A (PubMed:11389899). Interacts with RAB7A (PubMed:14998988). Interacts with PRKN (PubMed:15987638). Interacts with ABL1 and ABL2 (PubMed:16678104). Interacts with EMAP2 (PubMed:19362550). Interacts with MAVS (PubMed:19734229)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with HIV-1 TAT protein"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with hepatitis B virus X protein (HBX)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"O14818-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":178,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000370861.1"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,71,178]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":70,"original":"MSYDRAITVFSPDGHLFQVEYAQEAVKKGSTAVGVRGRDI","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":70,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":69,"foldedMissing":69,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-O14818-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O14818-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":94,"plddt":[[90,128],[70,7],[90,30],[70,2],[90,1],[70,9],[50,1]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"O14818-4","name":"3","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":149,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000370858.3"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,116]],"edits":[{"start":117,"end":248,"original":"RYTQSNGRRPFGISALIVGFDFDGTPRLYQTDPSGTYHAW","replacement":"VGACPLACSPLAAGQSRLRHGGSCHVTSGESEN","added":33}],"missing":132,"replaced":0,"novel":33,"foldedAbsent":131,"foldedMissing":131,"features":[[0,1,0],[1,1,0],[2,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-O14818-4-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O14818-4-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":79,"plddt":[[50,8],[70,34],[90,3],[70,16],[90,6],[70,1],[90,5],[70,8],[90,18],[70,2],[90,2],[70,2],[90,2],[70,1],[90,3],[70,6],[50,6],[70,7],[50,14],[0,5]],"losingConfidence":0}}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000101182.16"],"unmapped":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[]},"coding":{"genes":[{"id":"ENSG00000101182","name":"PSMA7","chromosome":"chr20","readthrough":false}],"gencode":11,"mapped":3},"explorer":{"gene":null,"isoforms